8%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9pod%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>重要 Flannel v0.13.0 在 Linux 5.15 内核下，VXLAN 的 checksum offload 功能导致校验和计算错误，报文携带 bad udp cksum 被丢弃，跨节点 Pod 无法通信。 环境说明 OS: Ubuntu 22.04, 内核 5.15.0-79-generic rke v1.2.6, K8s v1.19.8, canal (flannel v0.13.0 + calico)</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Flannel</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>RKE 节点清理指南</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-5-rke%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%B8%85%E7%90%86%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Aug 2023 20:05:11 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 29 Aug 2023 20:05:11 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-5-rke%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%B8%85%E7%90%86%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>重要 部署异常需要重来时，仅 rke remove 不够——需要清理节点上残留的容器、镜像、网络接口和目录。 环境说明 rke v1.2.6 K8s v1.19.6 步骤 1. Drain 节点 1 kubectl drain &amp;lt;node-name&amp;gt; --ignore-daemonsets 2. 移除节点 编辑 c</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>RKE</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>运维</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>k8s部署实录-3-rke部署集群忽略docker版本校验</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-3-rke%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%BF%BD%E7%95%A5docker%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E6%A0%A1%E9%AA%8C/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 21:15:10 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 21:15:10 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-3-rke%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%BF%BD%E7%95%A5docker%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E6%A0%A1%E9%AA%8C/</guid><description>重要 rke 默认校验 Docker 版本。config.yml 中的 ignore_docker_version: true 不生效，必须传 CLI 参数 --ignore-docker-version。 环境说明 rke v1.2.6 Kubernetes v1.19 Docker CE v</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>RKE</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>k8s部署实录-2-rke指定ssh_key_path替换默认密钥路径</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-2-rke%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9Assh_key_path%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%8C%E6%9B%BF%E6%8D%A2%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 20:28:18 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 20:28:18 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-2-rke%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9Assh_key_path%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%8C%E6%9B%BF%E6%8D%A2%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84/</guid><description>重要 rke 默认读取 ~/.ssh/id_rsa。如果 SSH 密钥使用 ed25519 等非 RSA 算法生成，需要在 cluster.yaml 中指定 ssh_key_path。 环境说明 rke v1.2.6 SSH 密钥算法：e</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>RKE</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>k8s部署实录-1-web控制台Esc快捷键与vim的热键冲突</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-1-web%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%B0esc%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E9%94%AE%E4%B8%8Evim%E7%9A%84%E7%83%AD%E9%94%AE%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 19:58:28 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 19:58:28 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-1-web%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%B0esc%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E9%94%AE%E4%B8%8Evim%E7%9A%84%E7%83%AD%E9%94%AE%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/</guid><description>重要 通过 JumpServer WebClient 编辑文件时，Esc 被浏览器拦截，Vim 无法退出插入模式。将 jj 映射为 &amp;lt;Esc&amp;gt; 即可绕过。 1.简介 客户现场只提供 JumpServer WebClient 连接，不提供 root 密码。通过</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Vim</category><category>JumpServer</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>跨级群DNS方案-解析各集群ingress与custom-dns记录</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-11-08-%E8%B7%A8%E7%BA%A7%E7%BE%A4dns%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%90%84%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4ingress%E4%B8%8Ecustom-dns%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Mon, 08 Nov 2021 02:36:40 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 08 Nov 2021 02:36:40 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-11-08-%E8%B7%A8%E7%BA%A7%E7%BE%A4dns%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%90%84%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4ingress%E4%B8%8Ecustom-dns%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>重要 环境说明 部署的external-dns包括以下组件: external-dns: k3s集群内部，kube-system命名空间 下载 etcd : k3s集群内部，paas命名</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes[PodSecurityPolicy]-使用说明</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-02-18-kubernetespodsecuritypolicy-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Feb 2021 10:19:23 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 18 Feb 2021 10:19:23 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-02-18-kubernetespodsecuritypolicy-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</guid><description>重要 Kubernetes: 1.20.2 Pod 安全策略 1. 什么是PodSecurityPolicy？ Pod 安全策略（Pod Security Policy） 是集群级别的资源，它能够控制 Pod 规约 中与安全性</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes 弃用 API 迁移说明</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-02-18-kubernetesrelease-%E5%BC%83%E7%94%A8api%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Feb 2021 07:10:42 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 18 Feb 2021 07:10:42 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-02-18-kubernetesrelease-%E5%BC%83%E7%94%A8api%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</guid><description>重要 Kubernetes 升级时 API 版本变更会导致已有 YAML 无法 kubectl apply。记录 v1.16 ~ v1.25 的主要 API 弃用变更，迁移时对照检查。 v1.16 资源 旧 API 新 API NetworkPolicy extensions/v1beta1 networking.k8s.io/v1 PodSecurityPolicy extensions/v1beta1 policy/v1beta1 DaemonSet extensions/v1beta1, apps/v1beta2 apps/v1 Deployment extensions/v1beta1, apps/v1beta1/2 apps/v1 StatefulSet</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>运维</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes 使用 Sidecar 配置 Filebeat 收集容器日志</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-27-kubernetes-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8sidecar%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEfilebeat%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 Jan 2021 09:37:06 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 27 Jan 2021 09:37:06 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-27-kubernetes-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8sidecar%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEfilebeat%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97/</guid><description>重要 K8s 中收集容器日志有两种模式： 模式 原理 优缺点 DaemonSet 每个 Node 部署一个日志采集 Pod，读 /var/log/containers 运维简单，但不支持自定义日志路径 Sidecar 在业务 Pod 内嵌入日志采集容</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Filebeat</category><category>Sidecar</category><category>日志</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>IngressController 启用证书透传</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-22-%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6--ingresscontroller%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E9%80%8F%E4%BC%A0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 22 Jan 2021 11:44:08 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 22 Jan 2021 11:44:08 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-22-%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6--ingresscontroller%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E9%80%8F%E4%BC%A0/</guid><description>重要 ingress-nginx 启用 SSL Passthrough（证书透传）需要两步：部署时加 --enable-ssl-passthrough 参数，Ingress 对象中设 ssl-redirect: &amp;quot;false&amp;quot;。 环境说明</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Ingress</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>故障排查--ExternalDNS只开放UDP53不开放TCP53导致网络超时</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-21-%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5--externaldns%E5%8F%AA%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEudp53%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEtcp53%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 Jan 2021 10:02:19 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 21 Jan 2021 10:02:19 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2021-01-21-%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5--externaldns%E5%8F%AA%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEudp53%E4%B8%8D%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BEtcp53%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6/</guid><description>重要 DNS 协议在响应包超过 512 字节时，会自动切换到 TCP 传输。如果 DNS Server 只开放 UDP 53 端口，部分解析请求会被截断，客户端重试 TCP 超时后才会 fallback。 环</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>DNS</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes-ingress-nginx 配置 gRPC 服务</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-11-06-kubernetes-ingress-nginx%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEgrpc%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2020 06:17:38 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 06 Nov 2020 06:17:38 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-11-06-kubernetes-ingress-nginx%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEgrpc%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1/</guid><description>重要 ingress-nginx 暴露 gRPC 服务时要求必须使用 TLS。两种方案： 方案 证书位置 适用场景 gRPCS（后端 TLS） 服务端自己管理证书 微服务内部已统一证书 gRPC（</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Ingress</category><category>gRPC</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes-CertManager解决ingress-tls证书问题</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-11-05-kubernetes-certmanager%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3ingress-tls%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2020 03:55:15 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 05 Nov 2020 03:55:15 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-11-05-kubernetes-certmanager%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3ingress-tls%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>重要 由于需要配置ingress-grpc,nginx-ingress要求tls加密。实现的方式有两种：一种在ingress注解grpcs,之</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>CertManager</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>PKI相关</category></item><item><title>K8s扩展-CRD概念与使用</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-08-13-crd-%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AFgo%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2020 10:07:59 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 13 Aug 2020 10:07:59 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-08-13-crd-%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AFgo%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B/</guid><description>系列导航 本系列按 K8S 扩展机制递进展开： 顺序 文章 定位 ① 本篇 - CRD 概念与使用 数据模型扩展——CRD 的定义、校验、版本管理 ② Operator 逻辑扩展——自定义控制器</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>CRD</category><category>CustomResourceDefinition</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Operator</category><category>k8s扩展</category></item><item><title>Minikube--增加外部dns解析</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-08-07-minikube--%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8dns%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2020 08:29:55 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 07 Aug 2020 08:29:55 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-08-07-minikube--%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8dns%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/</guid><description>重要 原理说明 kubernetes集群并采用Coredns进行解析，集群内部的服务都能通过内部域名进行访问。但是集群内部的coredns与物理</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Coredns</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Kubernetes 集群中以非 root 启动容器</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-06-28-docker-kubernetes%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%A5%E9%9D%9Eroot%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2020 09:36:19 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sun, 28 Jun 2020 09:36:19 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-06-28-docker-kubernetes%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E4%B8%AD%E4%BB%A5%E9%9D%9Eroot%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8/</guid><description>重要 容器默认以 root 运行，与宿主机 root 共享同一 UID 空间。一旦容器可访问宿主机资源，等同于宿主机 root 权限。 1. 问题 安全漏洞 CVE-2019-11245：容</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Security</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>K8s 扩展性机制——从基础设施到自定义控制器</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-29-k8s%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%E6%80%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6-cri-cni-csi-deviceplugin-scheduler-crd/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2020 00:52:19 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 29 May 2020 00:52:19 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-29-k8s%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%E6%80%A7%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6-cri-cni-csi-deviceplugin-scheduler-crd/</guid><description>重要 Kubernetes 核心只做编排——调度、声明式 API、状态协调。容器的运行时、网络、存储、GPU、调度策略、自定义 API，全部通过扩展机制交给外部插件。</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>CNI</category><category>CSI</category><category>CRI</category><category>DevicePlugin</category><category>CRD</category><category>Operator</category><category>Scheduler</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s基石</category></item><item><title>k8S-使用client-go操作集群</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-28-k8s-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8client-go%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 11:16:44 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 28 May 2020 11:16:44 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-28-k8s-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8client-go%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4/</guid><description>重要 client-go 是 K8S 官方 Go 客户端库，几乎所有 Go 写的 K8S 工具/Operator 底层都是它。 本文按实战需求渐近展开：客户端初始化 → 内置资源 CRUD → Dynamic Client 操作 CRD → Informer</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Client-go</category><category>Go</category><category>Informer</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>解析 K8s YAML 为 client-go 中的 data structs</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-25-%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90k8s-yaml%E6%88%90client-go%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84data-structs/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2020 03:35:11 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 25 May 2020 03:35:11 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-05-25-%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90k8s-yaml%E6%88%90client-go%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84data-structs/</guid><description>重要 client-go 的 scheme.Codecs.UniversalDeserializer().Decode 可以将 YAML 字符串解码为 runtime.Object。结合 --- 分割多文档 YAML，就能一次性解析 helm get manifest 的输出。 环境说明 Helm 3 Kubernetes v1.15.6 1. 核心函数</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Go</category><category>client-go</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>Minikube 本地启动</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-04-20-minikube%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2020 09:05:07 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 23 Apr 2020 09:05:07 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2020-04-20-minikube%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>重要 Minikube 镜像在 k8s.gcr.io 上，国内需要指定 --image-repository 使用阿里云镜像。 环境说明 Ubuntu 18.04 driver = docker 1. 安装 验证硬件虚拟化支持： 1 grep -E --color &amp;#39;vmx|svm&amp;#39; /proc/cpuinfo 安装 kubectl： 1 2 curl -LO &amp;#34;https://dl.k8s.io/release/$(curl -s https://dl.k8s.io/release/stable.txt)/bin/linux/amd64/kubectl&amp;#34; chmod</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Minikube</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item><item><title>kubectl 小技巧</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2019-12-13-k8s%E5%B0%8F%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Dec 2019 08:49:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 13 Dec 2019 08:49:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2019-12-13-k8s%E5%B0%8F%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</guid><description>重要 三个 kubectl 高频小技巧：自动补全、go-template 自定义输出、强制删除卡在 Terminating 的 namespace。 1. Kubectl 自动补全 1 2 3 apt install bash-completion echo &amp;#34;source &amp;lt;(kubectl completion bash)&amp;#34; &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Kubernetes</category><category>运维笔记</category><category>Kubernetes</category></item></channel></rss>